# Subagent Auto-Routing (Mandatory)

Project subagents live in `.cursor/agents/`. When a user task matches a row below, **automatically delegate** via the Task tool / subagent invocation. Do not silently do the specialist's job in the parent thread when a matching agent exists.

## Routing table

| User task signals | Auto-use agent | Timing | Anti-triggers (do not use for) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Landing/branded/marketing UI, hero, first viewport, visual composition, "looks AI", brand hierarchy | `frontend-design` | **Before** implementing UI | App Router plumbing, CRUD without branded need, docs sync, sceptic review |
| Portal pages/components/forms, App Router, Server Actions UI, Tailwind in `apps/portal`, a11y wiring | `frontend-implementer` | **When** building/changing portal UI | End-to-end vertical slice (nextjs-fullstack), branded first-viewport, docs sync, sceptic |
| End-to-end portal feature, Next.js fullstack slice, RSC+Server Actions+data+UI together, "fullstack", vertical slice | `nextjs-fullstack` | **When** feature spans UI + server data/actions | UI-only paint, branded hero only, pure API architecture, docs, sceptic |
| Skills, rules, agents, hooks, AGENTS drift, wiki, docs sync, transcript-derived durable patterns | `agents-memory-updater` | **When** auditing/changing AI/docs surfaces | Product UI, visual design, formal alignment score, adversarial code review |
| Review, reality-check, "is this done", verify fix, PR/diff critique, production readiness, sceptic/skeptic | `sceptic` | **After** non-trivial changes, **before** claiming done | Formal score emission, UI implementation, docs sync |
| Vercel, eve, v0 logos, Geist Brands, partner marks in taskbar/login chrome | `vercel-brand-sync` | **When** auditing/updating Vercel-family brand assets | General UI impl, docs sync, sceptic |
